{"slug":"la-las-vegas-two-days","title":"LA to Las Vegas and back in a Rivian: a two-day sample plan","intro":"Two days, 530 miles, from Pasadena to Las Vegas and home again. Day one stops once, at the Rivian Adventure Network site in Barstow, and ends at a Las Vegas hotel with a Level 2 charger, where an overnight at 6 kW adds about 79 kWh by morning. Day two needs only a short top-up at Primm before the run back. Times, charge levels and costs are estimates for the sample truck, and the hotel is a sample stop with a Level 2 charger, not a real listing; on a real trip, check a hotel's charger before you rely on it.","demo_url":"https://demo.rivolt.dev/trips/plan?preset=919ca13a-123f-5423-994d-12d7ccd31319","signup_url":"/signup","currency":"USD","totals":{"distance_mi":529.9,"drive_min":452.7,"charge_min":21.4,"charge_stops":2,"dcfc_cost_est":19.37},"days":[{"label":"Day 1","depart_at":"2026-11-14T16:00:00Z","arrive_at":"2026-11-14T20:04:23Z","from":"Rose Bowl parking (sample)","to":"Las Vegas, NV","distance_mi":263.9,"drive_min":226.2,"arrival_soc":30.1,"stops":[{"name":"Barstow, CA [Rivian Adventure Network]","lat":34.851348,"lon":-117.082573,"network":"Rivian Adventure Network","arrive_soc":58.4,"depart_soc":80,"charge_min":18.2,"max_kw":150,"cost_est":16.98}],"overnight":{"name":"Las Vegas hotel (sample)","parked_hours":45.3,"l2_kw":6,"added_kwh":78.5,"soc_after":90}},{"label":"Day 2","depart_at":"2026-11-16T17:20:00Z","arrive_at":"2026-11-16T21:09:43Z","from":"Las Vegas, NV","to":"Rose Bowl parking (sample)","distance_mi":266,"drive_min":226.5,"arrival_soc":11.7,"stops":[{"name":"Primm, NV [Electrify America]","lat":35.606006,"lon":-115.38908,"network":"Electrify America","arrive_soc":76.2,"depart_soc":80,"charge_min":3.2,"max_kw":150,"cost_est":2.39}],"overnight":null}],"route":[[34.161331,-118.166143],[34.159071,-118.167067],[34.158932,-118.167558],[34.156223,-118.167363],[34.156498,-118.165945],[34.157946,-118.163296],[34.1593,-118.161731],[34.16195,-118.16